@Pricely.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136
@Keycloak = http://localhost:8180

### Access token of the development user (realm pricely, client pricely-dev, password grant: local development only)
# @name token
POST {{Keycloak}}/realms/pricely/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=pricely-dev&username=dev&password=dev&scope=openid pricely.read

###
@accessToken = {{token.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 401 without a token, 200 with one
GET {{Pricely.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### MCP: list the tools
POST {{Pricely.Api_HostAddress}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list"}
